{"additions":251,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Closes #196\n\n## What\n\n- While no run is active, the Workflow Runs column sends one `If-None-Match` request per `github-poll-interval` for the newest run (`repos/{owner}/{repo}/actions/runs?per_page=1`). A `304` is free; only a moved answer re-fetches the list, so a run that starts shows up without `r`.\n- The re-fetch while a run is active, idle ×6 / low-quota ×2 / stop, the rate-limit backoff and `github-auto-refresh \"off\"` are unchanged.\n- One list fetch = 2 REST requests (measured with `GH_DEBUG=api`); the probe adds 2 only on a change. No GraphQL points are spent.\n\n## Implementation\n\n- `client.rs`: the issue / PR `check_lists` and the new `check_runs` share `run_check` / `parse_check` (only the function that picks `updated_at` out of the body differs).\n- `state.rs`: `runs_watermark` / `runs_check_inflight` / `last_runs_check`, `GhBgMessage::RunsCheck`, `apply_runs_check`. The probe runs only while `has_active()` is false.\n- `fixtures.rs`: `vig fixtures record` records the probe too, keeping status / ETag / body only. `tape/fixtures/api_-i_repos_owner_repo_actions_runs_per_page_1.out` added (replayed by the demo and the fixture test, always the baseline).\n\n## Docs\n\nREADME (en / ja), the GitHub view chapter (en / ja), `github-poll-interval` in the Config Reference (en / ja).\n\n## Tests\n\n- `runs_check_reads_the_newest_run_and_names_its_endpoint` (client)\n- `runs_change_check_baseline_then_change_refetches_runs` (state)\n- `the_runs_change_check_runs_only_while_no_run_is_active` (state)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01M94PeHgj7WRDiGDbKm91Mb","changedFiles":10,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-15T06:14:56Z","deletions":35,"headRefName":"feat/runs-change-check","isDraft":false,"labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":197,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABSY0V1g","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Copilot was unable to review this pull request because the user who requested the review has reached their quota limit.","submittedAt":"2026-10-15T06:15:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"b2f4acb9d7d1d49eeca905d6e2de493d968dcfc1"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-15T06:25:29Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/38692316891/job/116280867919","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-10-15T06:25:36Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-15T06:17:53Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/38691292070/job/116277550199","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-15T06:15:03Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-15T06:16:36Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/38691292022/job/116277549579","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-10-15T06:15:03Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-15T06:17:59Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/38691292070/job/116277550153","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-10-15T06:15:05Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-15T06:24:38Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/38691292070/job/116277550033","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-15T06:15:13Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-15T06:24:38Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/38691292070/job/116280560310","name":"upload","startedAt":"2026-10-15T06:24:38Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-15T06:25:29Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/38692316891/job/116280835323","name":"publish","startedAt":"2026-10-15T06:25:30Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-15T06:17:22Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/38691292022/job/116277549858","name":"test (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-15T06:15:03Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-15T06:18:17Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/38691292022/job/116277549734","name":"test (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-15T06:15:09Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-15T06:25:29Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/38692316891/job/116280834806","name":"homebrew","startedAt":"2026-10-15T06:25:30Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"}],"title":"✨ GitHub: the runs list refreshes itself through a conditional change check"}
